## Common Patterns

### Optional Values

```c
// Return none
return lean_io_result_mk_ok(lean_mk_option_none());

// Return some value
return lean_io_result_mk_ok(lean_mk_option_some(value));
```

### Error Handling

```c
// Return IO error
if (error) {
    lean_object* err = lean_mk_io_user_error(
        lean_mk_string("Error message")
    );
    return lean_io_result_mk_error(err);
}
